===============================================================================
Third-party notices
===============================================================================

mermaid2svg is a port. Its diagram grammars, layout rules, theme variables and
default geometry are reimplementations of mermaid's, and its command-line
interface is modelled on mermaid-cli's. It contains no code from either
project, and is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.

The `tests/corpus/upstream/` directory additionally contains diagram sources
copied verbatim from mermaid-cli's `test-positive/` regression suite; see the
PROVENANCE note beside them.

Both projects are MIT licensed, and their notices follow.


